sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as WP Admin UI
    participant Plugin as Context Alt Text (WP)
    participant Backend as Recognition API (HF Spaces)
    participant Storage as Media Library

    Admin->>Plugin: Open media item (attachment)
    Plugin->>Storage: Load attachment metadata & thumbnail
    Admin->>Plugin: Click "Identify faces"
    Plugin->>Backend: POST /api/v0/analyze-scene (attachment URL)
    Backend-->>Plugin: SceneAnalysisResult (faces, landmarks, confidence)
    Plugin->>Admin: Render bounding boxes & roster suggestions
    Admin->>Plugin: Confirm roster match
    Plugin->>Backend: PATCH /api/v0/roster/{remoteId} (add observation embedding)
    Backend-->>Plugin: Updated roster entry
    Plugin->>Storage: Persist observation + remote_id locally
    Plugin-->>Admin: Show synced badge + confidence score
